{"ID":"20240118151309-fjpkuh1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151309-fjpkuh1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151309-fjpkuh1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151309-6uh50wt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094739-lqiksq4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122094739-lqiksq4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"080白兔藿","type":"doc","updated":"20240129163652"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151309-6uh50wt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151309-6uh50wt","updated":"20240122094738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主蛇虺蜂藌猘狗蔡肉蛊毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122094735-gi9cy22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094735-gi9cy22"}},{"ID":"20240122094739-lqiksq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122094739-lqiksq4","updated":"20240129163652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第80味药，白兔藿。这个药现今呢罕有，过去常常用作解毒的药，现代呢已经没有人看得懂这个药，像疯狗咬伤，蛇咬伤啊，蜜蜂咬伤，吃到食物的中毒啊，都可以使用，现代人，不太认得这个药长什么样子了，太久了所以失落了，我们中华文化失落了，很多东西失落掉了，啊，很可惜。"}]}]}